IV
the construction activities related to them and the work tasks corresponding to each activity.
Taking the interval tunnels constructed by the shield method as the main object of research, a
detailed WBS level decomposition is carried out, so as to identify the precursor information
of the safety risks of metro construction in terms of people, things, environment, management
and other dimensions. The collected metro construction accidents are statistically analysed to
determine the types of risk events, analyse the possible risks, and construct the precursor
information system of people-objects-environment-management.
(3) On the basis of ontology theory research, this resesrch use the ontology editing tool
Protégésoftware, adopt the five-step ontology development method based on the "seven-step
method", and draw on the process of the Ontology Development 101 manual to clarify the
construction objectives, requirements, and forms of knowledge representation, etc. We define
five major categories of metro construction projects, construction activities, precursor
information, risk events, safety measures, and their subcategories, as well as corresponding
attributes and relationships. By defining the five categories of metro construction projects,
construction activities, precursor information, risk events and safety measures, and their
subcategories, as well as the corresponding attributes and relationships, the knowledge base of
the metro shield construction safety risk ontology is constructed.
(4) The knowledge query function is applied according to the constructed construction
safety risk ontology knowledge base. On the basis of the constructed construction safety risk
knowledge management model, the SWRL (Semantic Web Rule Language) safety rule base is
established with the help of Protégé's own plug-in SWRLTab, and the ontology reasoning
technology is introduced, which inputs the extracted ontology knowledge of the construction
safety risk instances and the corresponding rules into the Drools reasoning engine to carry out
rule reasoning. The ontology reasoning technology is introduced, and the extracted
construction safety risk instance ontology knowledge and corresponding rules are inputted
into Drools reasoning engine for rule reasoning to identify the possible risk events and the
safety measures to be taken for the risk events, so as to realise the intelligent pre-control of
metro construction safety risks.
Through the research, this paper realises the decomposition of underground construction
activities and the construction of precursor information system from the perspective of
different working methods, constructs the underground construction safety risk knowledge
base based on the ontology technology, and carries out the analysis of practical application by
taking the shield tectonics construction accident as an example. It is proved that the research
method can realise the systematic and structured storage of case knowledge and empirical
knowledge of underground construction safety risk. The research results realise the


